@* What the tree page shows until the canvas is ready: the canvas's own green surface with a
   faint, lopsided sketch of a family tree. Used twice so the two waits read as one: inside
   App.razor's #ft-splash (before the circuit connects) and by Home.razor (while it loads
   people and resolves focus). Both place it identically, so the swap between them is
   invisible. Static markup only, so it renders in App.razor's non-interactive shell. *@

<div class="ft-loading-surface" role="status">
    <div class="ft-loading-art">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 340 236" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
            @* Couple, then three children (uneven on purpose), a spouse, a grandchild *@
            <g class="ft-loading-lines">
                <path d="M104 52 Q104 74 146 74 Q188 74 188 52" />
                <path d="M146 74 V100" />
                <path d="M62 100 H262" />
                <path d="M62 100 V112" />
                <path d="M172 100 V112" />
                <path d="M262 100 V112" />
                <path d="M62 148 V190" />
                <path d="M280 130 H290" />
            </g>
            <g class="ft-loading-nodes">
                <circle class="g1" cx="104" cy="32" r="21" />
                <circle class="g1" cx="188" cy="32" r="21" />
                <circle class="g2" cx="62" cy="130" r="18" />
                <circle class="g2" cx="172" cy="130" r="18" />
                <circle class="g2" cx="262" cy="130" r="18" />
                <circle class="g2" cx="308" cy="130" r="16" />
                <circle class="g3" cx="62" cy="208" r="15" />
            </g>
        </svg>
        <p class="ft-loading-text">Opening your tree</p>
    </div>
</div>
